{"id": "nat_0", "text": "The birch canoe slid on the smooth planks.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 4.249422073364258, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.4497944150149653, "dnsmos_sig": 3.0890416793028415, "dnsmos_bak": 3.2424220263961616}
{"id": "nat_1", "text": "Glue the sheet to the dark blue background.", "audio_duration_s": 2.8, "utmos": 3.65360689163208, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.44310694934794, "dnsmos_sig": 3.334270868161902, "dnsmos_bak": 2.6711555389605612}
{"id": "nat_2", "text": "It is easy to tell the depth of a well.", "audio_duration_s": 2.8, "utmos": 4.280373573303223, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.789975834319093, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2777564721538117, "dnsmos_bak": 3.650375453924484}
{"id": "nat_3", "text": "These days a chicken leg is a rare dish.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.362521648406982, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.132976481526804, "dnsmos_sig": 3.511639722015356, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8357091932874265}
{"id": "nat_4", "text": "Rice is often served in round bowls.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.5461721420288086, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.583437975112375, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2087019438882027, "dnsmos_bak": 3.3104499969506294}
{"id": "nat_5", "text": "The juice of lemons makes fine punch.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.00724983215332, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.320567563602352, "dnsmos_sig": 3.0895261560967597, "dnsmos_bak": 2.9088746935894227}
{"id": "nat_6", "text": "The box was thrown beside the parked truck.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 4.005178451538086, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.753895799092871, "dnsmos_sig": 3.648263110881334, "dnsmos_bak": 2.8916345780724493}
{"id": "nat_7", "text": "The hogs were fed chopped corn and garbage.", "audio_duration_s": 2.8, "utmos": 3.8923139572143555, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7157451822047625, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2654836321369034, "dnsmos_bak": 3.4165624119621354}
{"id": "nat_8", "text": "Four hours of steady work faced us.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 3.2903177738189697, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.511668559507009, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3868564389503613, "dnsmos_bak": 2.900194196930801}
{"id": "nat_9", "text": "Large size in stockings is hard to sell.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.920915126800537, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1652398075394625, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5629213950286713, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8116710981845134}
{"id": "nat_10", "text": "The boy was there when the sun rose.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 3.9155445098876953, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.1009407602338332, "dnsmos_sig": 3.008667361361301, "dnsmos_bak": 2.688995545058351}
{"id": "nat_11", "text": "A rod is used to catch pink salmon.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 4.139165878295898, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.822030743949545, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3984114730340895, "dnsmos_bak": 3.4264173815981502}
{"id": "nat_12", "text": "The source of the huge river is the clear spring.", "audio_duration_s": 3.066666666666667, "utmos": 3.924593925476074, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.770381874752639, "dnsmos_sig": 3.360534911147246, "dnsmos_bak": 3.3777064187195847}
{"id": "nat_13", "text": "Kick the ball straight and follow through.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.8141040802001953, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.3358789719906046, "dnsmos_sig": 3.1506347385436664, "dnsmos_bak": 2.8713277809150703}
{"id": "nat_14", "text": "Help the woman get back to her feet.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8666666666666667, "utmos": 3.2338149547576904, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2447820549430872, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5768225738572914, "dnsmos_bak": 4.015384563030779}
{"id": "nat_15", "text": "A blue crane is a tall wading bird.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 4.334351539611816, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.8219482189731475, "dnsmos_sig": 3.286960487260726, "dnsmos_bak": 3.6246866608823938}
{"id": "nat_16", "text": "It is hard to erase blue or red ink.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.672666549682617, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.8759665632168936, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5357415592288723, "dnsmos_bak": 3.3537565598855323}
{"id": "nat_17", "text": "Write quickly and meet me at the dock.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 3.404965877532959, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9329794261312574, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5223023803483025, "dnsmos_bak": 3.4768557740628303}
{"id": "nat_18", "text": "The two talked quietly in the dim light.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.5414814949035645, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.5481983959454544, "dnsmos_sig": 3.490924248717549, "dnsmos_bak": 2.631220518185865}
{"id": "nat_19", "text": "The hail pattered on the burnt red tiles.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.5608627796173096, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.549491745175587, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3342788985334195, "dnsmos_bak": 2.9766453045569423}
{"id": "nat_20", "text": "The sand drifted down the steep slope.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 4.361500263214111, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.678427003276919, "dnsmos_sig": 3.532112334595113, "dnsmos_bak": 2.943055623855618}
{"id": "nat_21", "text": "Oak is strong and also gives shade.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.588809013366699, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.629305799696063, "dnsmos_sig": 3.39573002910384, "dnsmos_bak": 3.0959318356348273}
{"id": "nat_22", "text": "Cats and dogs each hate the other.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7333333333333334, "utmos": 3.9375524520874023, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2354643968492267, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5911032761599433, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9851114127747547}
{"id": "nat_23", "text": "The pipe began to rust while new.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.869286060333252, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.902465589761484, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4208728053094113, "dnsmos_bak": 3.6092631973658387}
{"id": "nat_24", "text": "Open the crate but don't break the glass.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.7143728733062744, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.853023218567597, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3525374333807645, "dnsmos_bak": 3.5580112377686963}
{"id": "nat_25", "text": "Add the sum to the product of these three.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 3.6430277824401855, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0071576880844915, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3794542264077685, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8113889535099905}
{"id": "nat_26", "text": "Thieves who rob friends deserve jail.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 2.967172861099243, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7775519927495878, "dnsmos_sig": 3.332014877621149, "dnsmos_bak": 3.5031734612628416}
{"id": "nat_27", "text": "The ripe taste of cheese improves with age.", "audio_duration_s": 2.8, "utmos": 3.8951172828674316, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9491789608433017, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2721531235195935, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9003873924256256}
{"id": "nat_28", "text": "Act on these orders with great speed.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 3.947998046875, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9618220051893345, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3666591427494192, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8173396998268316}
{"id": "nat_29", "text": "The hush of night came on the water.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.8236937522888184, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.5828809172269587, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5750492771825395, "dnsmos_bak": 2.817378923433293}
{"id": "nat_30", "text": "Flax makes linen for many a dress.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.2722487449646, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.5068518435143905, "dnsmos_sig": 3.269601864678074, "dnsmos_bak": 2.9286142806801245}
{"id": "nat_31", "text": "Hoist the load to your left shoulder.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.9328773021698, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7270834146975087, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4548437655509896, "dnsmos_bak": 3.177690311833717}
{"id": "nat_32", "text": "Take the winding path to reach the lake.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 3.9212257862091064, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.07158217330576, "dnsmos_sig": 3.444570447469269, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9185135207720307}
{"id": "nat_33", "text": "Note closely the size of the gas tank.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 4.361611366271973, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.275784836271488, "dnsmos_sig": 3.549975551902847, "dnsmos_bak": 4.0868729634056145}
{"id": "nat_34", "text": "Wipe the grease off his dirty face.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 4.254492282867432, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0019694933879637, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3657253714307664, "dnsmos_bak": 3.788986912210848}
{"id": "nat_35", "text": "Mend the coat before wearing it again.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8666666666666667, "utmos": 3.440706968307495, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.132742463833618, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5191478808413104, "dnsmos_bak": 3.903831395966313}
{"id": "nat_36", "text": "The lease ran out in sixteen weeks.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.165126323699951, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.5011131838408005, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2395475745127857, "dnsmos_bak": 3.0771822338406225}
{"id": "nat_37", "text": "Both parts of the design came together.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 3.5772526264190674, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7733624407375643, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4432459660234764, "dnsmos_bak": 3.154566437424348}
{"id": "nat_38", "text": "Sewing hems and darns takes skill.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 4.165279865264893, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.764946523912935, "dnsmos_sig": 3.581949680670395, "dnsmos_bak": 2.968516246278571}
{"id": "nat_39", "text": "The architect planned a new city hall.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 4.117475986480713, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.4536764858990874, "dnsmos_sig": 3.29101957265339, "dnsmos_bak": 2.942202509142572}
{"id": "nat_40", "text": "The small red lamp stood in a corner.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 4.012094974517822, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.956635211088121, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4260578970413227, "dnsmos_bak": 3.7701647483868053}
{"id": "nat_41", "text": "The large box came by truck to town.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.9681642055511475, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7696159198482797, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4245911292280096, "dnsmos_bak": 3.3413246499056535}
{"id": "nat_42", "text": "The men fought hard to save the fort.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 3.7665343284606934, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.641633564726207, "dnsmos_sig": 3.122254904892275, "dnsmos_bak": 3.4672722096848574}
{"id": "nat_43", "text": "The horse chewed his bit and nodded.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8666666666666667, "utmos": 4.107954978942871, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.273866987234504, "dnsmos_sig": 3.377305765926625, "dnsmos_bak": 2.5023823211736462}
{"id": "nat_44", "text": "Three of the men were hurt badly.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 3.080606460571289, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.1789568306422695, "dnsmos_sig": 3.0800273267419613, "dnsmos_bak": 2.9357056164117856}
{"id": "nat_45", "text": "Ripe pears are fit for a queen's table.", "audio_duration_s": 2.8, "utmos": 3.898613929748535, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9005676661913258, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4349783740455706, "dnsmos_bak": 3.581684997023114}
{"id": "nat_46", "text": "The dark room was lit by a red light.", "audio_duration_s": 2.8, "utmos": 3.865534543991089, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.043213246206375, "dnsmos_sig": 3.394546433645713, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8761948144278837}
{"id": "nat_47", "text": "The fox hid in the tall grass nearby.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.02964973449707, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7255867624897725, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3728074212910997, "dnsmos_bak": 3.1403645749871965}
{"id": "nat_48", "text": "We saw eight tiny goats on the hillside.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 3.191039562225342, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.283907281211673, "dnsmos_sig": 3.1283915896312617, "dnsmos_bak": 2.8579078034932417}
{"id": "nat_49", "text": "The cats purred softly on the warm rug.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.849848508834839, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1467196180353585, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5775956296337705, "dnsmos_bak": 3.750301564566981}
{"id": "nat_50", "text": "The silver bell rang at dawn.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 4.248177528381348, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9015541224549586, "dnsmos_sig": 3.198877043224005, "dnsmos_bak": 3.925226694903474}
{"id": "nat_51", "text": "The crowd cheered the band with pride.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 4.124090194702148, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.998271565348137, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4295445075699704, "dnsmos_bak": 3.7829568438302457}
{"id": "nat_52", "text": "She baked fresh bread every morning.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 4.3464250564575195, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.3089174604482756, "dnsmos_sig": 2.9987428551810695, "dnsmos_bak": 3.175795765628238}
{"id": "nat_53", "text": "The train reached the bridge at noon.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 4.0146098136901855, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.022427617461818, "dnsmos_sig": 3.414671520049285, "dnsmos_bak": 3.82861047336253}
{"id": "nat_54", "text": "Cool winds blew from the distant peaks.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.8433656692504883, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1999446900460637, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5981352093640937, "dnsmos_bak": 3.797640146356116}
{"id": "nat_55", "text": "The old dog slept by the warm fire.", "audio_duration_s": 2.933333333333333, "utmos": 3.027352809906006, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.8337662022823378, "dnsmos_sig": 3.219470985007028, "dnsmos_bak": 3.7899516583760353}
{"id": "nat_56", "text": "Bright stars filled the clear night sky.", "audio_duration_s": 2.933333333333333, "utmos": 3.3052525520324707, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.660913651757616, "dnsmos_sig": 3.430088076399533, "dnsmos_bak": 3.0229386386708845}
{"id": "nat_57", "text": "The child built a castle in the sand.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.82480525970459, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.8213594419265027, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4872868668345904, "dnsmos_bak": 3.2271038880780956}
{"id": "nat_58", "text": "Rain soaked the dry and barren plain.", "audio_duration_s": 2.8, "utmos": 4.12819766998291, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1740978671800235, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4832403284012488, "dnsmos_bak": 4.013177799808593}
{"id": "nat_59", "text": "The boat moved quietly past the shore.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 3.634807586669922, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9791132080082674, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5046617173705, "dnsmos_bak": 3.662079896831177}
{"id": "nat_60", "text": "Plums ripen in the warm summer sun.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.6880245208740234, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.4791845530773116, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5322427243262435, "dnsmos_bak": 2.4395180641592136}
{"id": "nat_61", "text": "The lock was jammed but opened at last.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.6720471382141113, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9299524587065804, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4331784797256804, "dnsmos_bak": 3.628845347820034}
{"id": "nat_62", "text": "The key to the cabinet was misplaced.", "audio_duration_s": 2.8, "utmos": 4.1226325035095215, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.007339692962269, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3905354770353946, "dnsmos_bak": 3.779839316084854}
{"id": "nat_63", "text": "The cup shattered on the stone floor.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.063197135925293, "dnsmos_ovrl": 1.9868694353314507, "dnsmos_sig": 2.981291429216102, "dnsmos_bak": 2.563680576774577}
{"id": "nat_64", "text": "A black bear crossed the narrow trail.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.518099308013916, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.8999118230081358, "dnsmos_sig": 3.411722219322538, "dnsmos_bak": 3.6204995857151143}
{"id": "nat_65", "text": "Fresh dew glistened on the green leaves.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 4.171608924865723, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.5182310349988235, "dnsmos_sig": 3.395052307264459, "dnsmos_bak": 2.861342835969245}
{"id": "nat_66", "text": "The lamp cast a soft glow on the table.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.704228401184082, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.211773698347842, "dnsmos_sig": 3.594015726949863, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9128292113844294}
{"id": "nat_67", "text": "Strong winds bent the tall pine trees.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 4.158318519592285, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.303975278239993, "dnsmos_sig": 3.530411007684261, "dnsmos_bak": 4.079425260784835}
{"id": "nat_68", "text": "A robin sang from the old oak branch.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 3.3346080780029297, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.328381989462033, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5296495264477215, "dnsmos_bak": 2.3188645095128373}
{"id": "nat_69", "text": "The crowd fell silent when he spoke.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.8631391525268555, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.849052056385346, "dnsmos_sig": 3.45725414311241, "dnsmos_bak": 3.345718306679949}
{"id": "nat_70", "text": "Green fields stretched to the far horizon.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.4091436862945557, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1790070377303614, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5198822299956003, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9018315306499547}
{"id": "nat_71", "text": "The river ran swift and cold today.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.075976371765137, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.6793273500019645, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4299246133290247, "dnsmos_bak": 3.1440509360253386}
{"id": "nat_72", "text": "The flag waved high in the morning breeze.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 3.923272132873535, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.591756558151391, "dnsmos_sig": 3.409547820989599, "dnsmos_bak": 3.031783388360477}
{"id": "nat_73", "text": "Blue jays flew low over the meadow.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.835470676422119, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.2078829659152586, "dnsmos_sig": 2.877978228953395, "dnsmos_bak": 3.021413479801012}
{"id": "nat_74", "text": "The forge was lit at break of day.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8666666666666667, "utmos": 3.652785539627075, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3226575014688478, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6501801884939704, "dnsmos_bak": 3.966224108311464}
{"id": "nat_75", "text": "The sparrows hopped on the garden wall.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 4.1718974113464355, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.194704136831622, "dnsmos_sig": 3.635463911549704, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8256474170671098}
{"id": "nat_76", "text": "Fill the car before you drive into town.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 3.874950885772705, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.974481395095193, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3179245698264936, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8857233239696747}
{"id": "nat_77", "text": "A cud of grass hung from the heifer's lip.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.9044413566589355, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7981126548055735, "dnsmos_sig": 3.57602582131583, "dnsmos_bak": 3.026286337788761}
{"id": "nat_78", "text": "The seed grew into a giant oak tree.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.981518268585205, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.144846411484047, "dnsmos_sig": 3.11418684389845, "dnsmos_bak": 2.4590542758134766}
{"id": "nat_79", "text": "A worm ate through the wooden plank.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 3.294250726699829, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1371920639540174, "dnsmos_sig": 3.481633458084309, "dnsmos_bak": 3.98002507725015}
{"id": "nat_80", "text": "The team scored in the last few seconds.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.7455122470855713, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1144121656537074, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4460299946645323, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9547199588443656}
{"id": "nat_81", "text": "The glass jar held the bright red jam.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 3.9079017639160156, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.121585185916753, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5060787124028874, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8134434668106305}
{"id": "nat_82", "text": "The leaves fell slowly in the autumn air.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 3.3672335147857666, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.245393482661158, "dnsmos_sig": 3.114226816919915, "dnsmos_bak": 2.7263537130043694}
{"id": "nat_83", "text": "The farmer planted seeds in long rows.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 4.237435817718506, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.449766620694779, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6619715947180542, "dnsmos_bak": 4.170779963702901}
{"id": "nat_84", "text": "The clock struck twelve at midnight.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.4398295879364014, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.3708297072043187, "dnsmos_sig": 3.404917137220694, "dnsmos_bak": 2.384205558742292}
{"id": "nat_85", "text": "A pale moon rose over the distant hills.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 4.067712783813477, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1357345808973496, "dnsmos_sig": 3.496241703692289, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8762082254237127}
{"id": "nat_86", "text": "The stream carved a path through the stone.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 3.9707460403442383, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.786233789488192, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5140284609424013, "dnsmos_bak": 3.0955737252074758}
{"id": "nat_87", "text": "Bright flowers bloomed along the fence.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.456000566482544, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1660731453679114, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4257778836725277, "dnsmos_bak": 4.081416782874819}
{"id": "nat_88", "text": "The snow lay deep on the mountain pass.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.7535576820373535, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.3101274678455757, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2320924196011904, "dnsmos_bak": 2.7242016794712884}
{"id": "nat_89", "text": "The eagle soared above the canyon rim.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.208255767822266, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.8368171071146704, "dnsmos_sig": 3.333589574467413, "dnsmos_bak": 3.66542888651502}
{"id": "nat_90", "text": "The gate swung open with a loud creak.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 4.25183629989624, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0604844605247186, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5335338665468123, "dnsmos_bak": 3.746456778468525}
{"id": "nat_91", "text": "The wolf howled at the cold winter moon.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.7948169708251953, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.381287619176469, "dnsmos_sig": 3.683132867231406, "dnsmos_bak": 4.043394817900331}
{"id": "nat_92", "text": "A candle flickered in the draft of wind.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.4796767234802246, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.550944917683591, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3171738309194643, "dnsmos_bak": 3.0893802319710617}
{"id": "nat_93", "text": "The road curved sharply past the barn.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.8064942359924316, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.6356749898960823, "dnsmos_sig": 3.313814552793649, "dnsmos_bak": 3.184054711377498}
{"id": "nat_94", "text": "Wool is spun into yarn for warm cloth.", "audio_duration_s": 2.8, "utmos": 4.076357841491699, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1347768983716073, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4925855300469255, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9747429064210578}
{"id": "nat_95", "text": "The crowd surged through the narrow gate.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.732593059539795, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.3863083953129, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3438837597649953, "dnsmos_bak": 2.5762475951986765}
{"id": "nat_96", "text": "The owl hunted mice in the dark field.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.944260597229004, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.488505174705172, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4543288646991, "dnsmos_bak": 2.6524583143912444}
{"id": "nat_97", "text": "The pond froze solid in January.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.135484218597412, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.793626995148508, "dnsmos_sig": 3.1844115011259913, "dnsmos_bak": 3.794943787698581}
{"id": "nat_98", "text": "A flock of geese flew in a V-shape.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 4.210987567901611, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7342537285150743, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2031608769287847, "dnsmos_bak": 3.5932069828919815}
{"id": "nat_99", "text": "The tide ebbed low on the rocky coast.", "audio_duration_s": 2.8, "utmos": 3.2328193187713623, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7065166993333234, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3593840830200437, "dnsmos_bak": 3.315382288599574}
{"id": "nat_100", "text": "The flame burned bright in the dark cave.", "audio_duration_s": 2.933333333333333, "utmos": 3.5928869247436523, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.128599314270076, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4065569258073634, "dnsmos_bak": 4.037774206002039}
{"id": "nat_101", "text": "The mill ground grain into fine flour.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.4235548973083496, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.120505218786342, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5455095230165456, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8287932636374125}
{"id": "nat_102", "text": "The stag grazed near the edge of the wood.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 3.2639150619506836, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7839152760185066, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4377020370640317, "dnsmos_bak": 3.217524519331402}
{"id": "nat_103", "text": "The well dried up in the hot summer.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 3.9466681480407715, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7991273929679275, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3560589625350232, "dnsmos_bak": 3.5023941626590926}
{"id": "nat_104", "text": "The swift brown fox ran past the log.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.653693675994873, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.567334213230385, "dnsmos_sig": 3.445321286445088, "dnsmos_bak": 2.836903558146278}
{"id": "nat_105", "text": "A stone wall bordered the old estate.", "audio_duration_s": 2.8, "utmos": 4.2181806564331055, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.638647733226515, "dnsmos_sig": 3.068186350260903, "dnsmos_bak": 3.58217885300648}
{"id": "nat_106", "text": "The bell rang twice before it stopped.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 4.039485931396484, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9924853360928934, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4615635095658535, "dnsmos_bak": 3.5634431281615795}
{"id": "nat_107", "text": "The hawk soared high on the warm updraft.", "audio_duration_s": 2.933333333333333, "utmos": 3.8764920234680176, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.3715655094302814, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4197555060321614, "dnsmos_bak": 2.348330197008993}
{"id": "nat_108", "text": "The sharp knife cut the rough cord.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 3.6959476470947266, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.8290633280667623, "dnsmos_sig": 3.254228381884492, "dnsmos_bak": 3.580026613995765}
{"id": "nat_109", "text": "The colt pranced in the wide green field.", "audio_duration_s": 3.3333333333333335, "utmos": 4.277122974395752, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.6882864958905683, "dnsmos_sig": 3.251663067215693, "dnsmos_bak": 3.3197870337609254}
{"id": "nat_110", "text": "A fish leaped from the calm blue lake.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 4.012773036956787, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.577610692924322, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3359248142537012, "dnsmos_bak": 2.976544046127971}
{"id": "nat_111", "text": "The damp ground smelled of fresh rain.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.008328914642334, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.5033439244738087, "dnsmos_sig": 3.383652045841449, "dnsmos_bak": 2.9694059000523536}
{"id": "nat_112", "text": "The cart was loaded with heavy stone.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 3.4574732780456543, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.548162957387174, "dnsmos_sig": 3.38206091402349, "dnsmos_bak": 2.865441402886809}
{"id": "nat_113", "text": "The long white rope coiled on the deck.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 3.392286539077759, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.09424925047014, "dnsmos_sig": 3.452048587576823, "dnsmos_bak": 4.003047757016587}
{"id": "nat_114", "text": "The pine tree grew tall and straight.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 4.323992729187012, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0359677496236124, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5431298893865826, "dnsmos_bak": 3.5745928041392308}
{"id": "nat_115", "text": "The coal burned slowly in the iron stove.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 4.1760053634643555, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.77035457360826, "dnsmos_sig": 3.421231439334076, "dnsmos_bak": 3.2995076924220763}
{"id": "nat_116", "text": "A gust of wind tore the sail apart.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 4.159041404724121, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.926411587230122, "dnsmos_sig": 3.374177536008693, "dnsmos_bak": 3.691112954650177}
{"id": "nat_117", "text": "The goat climbed steep rocky paths easily.", "audio_duration_s": 2.8, "utmos": 3.7514123916625977, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0758877236635325, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4200169737178765, "dnsmos_bak": 3.892847050311991}
{"id": "nat_118", "text": "The red sun sank below the flat plain.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 4.243950843811035, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2400808739875355, "dnsmos_sig": 3.607314735327231, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9166327842645288}
{"id": "nat_119", "text": "The wheat field swayed in the warm breeze.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 4.12352991104126, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.978134430978471, "dnsmos_sig": 3.322172354720053, "dnsmos_bak": 3.88563546948855}
{"id": "nat_120", "text": "The thick fog rolled in from the sea.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.366446018218994, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.009980301327067, "dnsmos_sig": 3.457008752250753, "dnsmos_bak": 3.671929975854785}
{"id": "nat_121", "text": "The drum beat loud and steady all night.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.9133617877960205, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.46380062858053, "dnsmos_sig": 2.923968406351544, "dnsmos_bak": 3.5751288488648503}
{"id": "nat_122", "text": "The fox left tracks in the new snow.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.9176206588745117, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0594698151010005, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4375317256844937, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8079622752455764}
{"id": "nat_123", "text": "The light faded as the sun went down.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 4.23323392868042, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.3422385918324484, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2471406019828177, "dnsmos_bak": 2.865514052083367}
{"id": "nat_124", "text": "A small boat drifted on the still lake.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 4.312743186950684, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.8837645242918017, "dnsmos_sig": 3.433825336088078, "dnsmos_bak": 3.4649931569039922}
{"id": "nat_125", "text": "The cook prepared a fresh pot of soup.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.295380592346191, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.82568641339056, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2549086720141496, "dnsmos_bak": 3.5526330910802812}
{"id": "nat_126", "text": "The old mill wheel turned in the stream.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.008697986602783, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.003831901778754, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4170223290856243, "dnsmos_bak": 3.772381618475218}
{"id": "nat_127", "text": "The long drought burned the crops dry.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.8736157417297363, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1357108228272437, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4167651212639356, "dnsmos_bak": 3.996802546944453}
{"id": "nat_128", "text": "The cool air smelled of pine and earth.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.5309817790985107, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.275759162580467, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6146823823646383, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9531726046867632}
{"id": "nat_129", "text": "The child ran barefoot in the wet grass.", "audio_duration_s": 3.066666666666667, "utmos": 3.9911646842956543, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.51245879555629, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3004875411477435, "dnsmos_bak": 2.885760280550111}
{"id": "nat_130", "text": "A kite soared high above the park.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.591796398162842, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.4849818675963338, "dnsmos_sig": 3.368749943407527, "dnsmos_bak": 2.8507429269618374}
{"id": "nat_131", "text": "The bridge shook as the truck rolled past.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.704984188079834, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.424597628799901, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2746760918779922, "dnsmos_bak": 2.792258170941868}
{"id": "nat_132", "text": "The soft light fell on the open book.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.8558647632598877, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.002655647917524, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5906470143734364, "dnsmos_bak": 3.510834695891469}
{"id": "nat_133", "text": "The crane lifted the heavy steel beam.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.9518938064575195, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1456435962135263, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4809832409512014, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9207677361934454}
{"id": "nat_134", "text": "The strong horse pulled the loaded cart.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 4.1904191970825195, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.6744878473436287, "dnsmos_sig": 3.389516237728377, "dnsmos_bak": 3.267706016967284}
{"id": "nat_135", "text": "The wind died down as night came on.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 4.222320556640625, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.8314723556376817, "dnsmos_sig": 3.563823186206883, "dnsmos_bak": 3.3508752046944528}
{"id": "nat_136", "text": "The bird built its nest in the fork of the branch.", "audio_duration_s": 3.2, "utmos": 4.024543762207031, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7204534131972236, "dnsmos_sig": 3.1913549080146537, "dnsmos_bak": 3.475849721002195}
{"id": "nat_137", "text": "The ice was thin near the river bank.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 3.924947500228882, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.024723874435464, "dnsmos_sig": 3.53669463817207, "dnsmos_bak": 3.6333031949371657}
{"id": "nat_138", "text": "The fog lifted slowly as the sun rose.", "audio_duration_s": 3.066666666666667, "utmos": 4.158089637756348, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.011030103136927, "dnsmos_sig": 3.460698199098872, "dnsmos_bak": 3.6740114950056486}
{"id": "nat_139", "text": "The fire crackled in the stone hearth.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.7775611877441406, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.8949951567963486, "dnsmos_sig": 3.417539026192101, "dnsmos_bak": 3.4603882761916473}
{"id": "nat_140", "text": "The long bridge arched over the bay.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.9804067611694336, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.69719976888385, "dnsmos_sig": 3.307781289785132, "dnsmos_bak": 3.428498877573769}
{"id": "nat_141", "text": "A cloud of dust rose from the dry road.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 4.029217720031738, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.101766397666436, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4286709935027018, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9745522319755526}
{"id": "nat_142", "text": "The swift stream ran over smooth stones.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.9631690979003906, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.404567139833606, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2108099408206927, "dnsmos_bak": 2.999726189762643}
{"id": "nat_143", "text": "The torch cast shadows on the old wall.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 3.7217555046081543, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.52153611953481, "dnsmos_sig": 3.495886809761015, "dnsmos_bak": 2.695389858306008}
{"id": "nat_144", "text": "The net was full of silver fish.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 3.6050357818603516, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.182309171513811, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4877175954758854, "dnsmos_bak": 3.944254765998483}
{"id": "nat_145", "text": "The tall grain stood ripe in the field.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 4.05172872543335, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7936839980192567, "dnsmos_sig": 3.1708108128867165, "dnsmos_bak": 3.6953791714508495}
{"id": "nat_146", "text": "The damp cloth wiped the dusty shelf.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 4.269742488861084, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1755549649906434, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6403126084926685, "dnsmos_bak": 3.729779688317527}
{"id": "nat_147", "text": "A mule team pulled the heavy plow.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 4.220922470092773, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.226522325167161, "dnsmos_sig": 3.542783301574956, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9848362663324894}
{"id": "nat_148", "text": "The old chair sat in the corner unused.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 3.2483630180358887, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0177041969989085, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4560643503422863, "dnsmos_bak": 3.7069391294313423}
{"id": "nat_149", "text": "The rain fell steadily through the night.", "audio_duration_s": 2.0, "utmos": 4.149962425231934, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.440856371875796, "dnsmos_sig": 2.8858224681538367, "dnsmos_bak": 3.484384545439769}
{"id": "nat_150", "text": "The lantern hung from the low beam.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7333333333333334, "utmos": 3.2329161167144775, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.640651295862061, "dnsmos_sig": 3.1222373486482238, "dnsmos_bak": 3.58505630208969}
{"id": "nat_151", "text": "The wind brought the smell of fresh hay.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.7206435203552246, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1546206744284038, "dnsmos_sig": 3.605953365154101, "dnsmos_bak": 3.759289086694035}
{"id": "nat_152", "text": "The stone path led to the small gate.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.110736846923828, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0708969845679883, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4176443643741132, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9189068336226}
{"id": "nat_153", "text": "The loud noise startled the sleeping dog.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.122337818145752, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.908223714556769, "dnsmos_sig": 3.578044582323619, "dnsmos_bak": 3.2847736320061993}
{"id": "nat_154", "text": "The canoe glided across the glassy lake.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.736959218978882, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1495230449481877, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5211096816872134, "dnsmos_bak": 3.840336036472195}
{"id": "nat_155", "text": "The long journey left them very tired.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.160609722137451, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.453700399359467, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3093898495824305, "dnsmos_bak": 3.0282006255620253}
{"id": "nat_156", "text": "The lark sang early in the damp morning.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 3.9415085315704346, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9930083184951597, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4997440502731716, "dnsmos_bak": 3.4962267290574527}
{"id": "nat_157", "text": "The bees hummed in the tall clover.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.885962963104248, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.671323401122128, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4190046008917134, "dnsmos_bak": 3.187051930837091}
{"id": "nat_158", "text": "The thick ice covered the frozen pond.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.348505973815918, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.0749235624516835, "dnsmos_sig": 3.321105732751049, "dnsmos_bak": 1.9300996028336599}
{"id": "nat_159", "text": "The young deer grazed near the tree line.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 4.131743907928467, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.6668967580771588, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2280491572374417, "dnsmos_bak": 3.5075610000940225}
{"id": "nat_160", "text": "The heavy rains swelled the quiet river.", "audio_duration_s": 2.8, "utmos": 3.9862711429595947, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.294453747917653, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2930322650054507, "dnsmos_bak": 2.4785034496708307}
{"id": "nat_161", "text": "The steep cliff dropped to the blue sea.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.781287908554077, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.2329819553574914, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2747658351804922, "dnsmos_bak": 2.5440244638189653}
{"id": "nat_162", "text": "The bright sparks flew from the anvil.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 4.126384735107422, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0181612012625285, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4056763641542007, "dnsmos_bak": 3.760522170954605}
{"id": "nat_163", "text": "The cold spring fed the old stone trough.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.509126663208008, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1131107152910693, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6501173692417113, "dnsmos_bak": 3.572558794586117}
{"id": "nat_164", "text": "The wild geese flew south at dusk.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 3.9440436363220215, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7320579187491556, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2887453816338907, "dnsmos_bak": 3.4467482174136155}
{"id": "nat_165", "text": "The soft moss covered the old log.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.626286029815674, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.6562950533403162, "dnsmos_sig": 3.514664398430969, "dnsmos_bak": 2.9138972594111396}
{"id": "nat_166", "text": "The sun shone warm on the stone bench.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.7977705001831055, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.951752397575053, "dnsmos_sig": 3.441790277720539, "dnsmos_bak": 3.588656797534995}
{"id": "nat_167", "text": "The fresh bread smelled good in the kitchen.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8666666666666667, "utmos": 3.6370644569396973, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.677975201357379, "dnsmos_sig": 3.331721563338121, "dnsmos_bak": 3.308286568571121}
{"id": "nat_168", "text": "The frog leaped from the muddy bank.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 3.259068727493286, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.77816161905364, "dnsmos_sig": 3.457741384615208, "dnsmos_bak": 3.3393699672696076}
{"id": "nat_169", "text": "The tall ship sailed out of the harbor.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 3.5957190990448, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.3473614073084312, "dnsmos_sig": 3.311371981116025, "dnsmos_bak": 2.745389533355634}
{"id": "nat_170", "text": "The thick smoke rose from the chimney.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.537243127822876, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.8807502049026623, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3729690519157067, "dnsmos_bak": 3.529999020165715}
{"id": "nat_171", "text": "The black cat sat on the warm sill.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 3.7271339893341064, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.086065422008956, "dnsmos_sig": 3.469307750443538, "dnsmos_bak": 3.853984670377652}
{"id": "nat_172", "text": "The wide valley lay green and still.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.8483917713165283, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7476459586819013, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4119755698824576, "dnsmos_bak": 3.2994707934811682}
{"id": "nat_173", "text": "The old well ran dry in late summer.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.139449119567871, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.6658491487960787, "dnsmos_sig": 3.1991820987319404, "dnsmos_bak": 3.4693681054255823}
{"id": "nat_174", "text": "The cold snap froze the small brook.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 4.312014579772949, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.803477928052142, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4283634858052228, "dnsmos_bak": 3.347784747313577}
{"id": "nat_175", "text": "The dew dried quickly in the warm sun.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.5437655448913574, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2553037434420284, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5857408062706217, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9010434816635495}
{"id": "nat_176", "text": "The sharp smell of pine filled the air.", "audio_duration_s": 2.1333333333333333, "utmos": 3.5764007568359375, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0878494321177357, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5528351210854585, "dnsmos_bak": 3.767246529993172}
{"id": "nat_177", "text": "The dog barked once and then was still.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.343208312988281, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.5036690643473776, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4465011316827727, "dnsmos_bak": 2.7007462115953427}
{"id": "nat_178", "text": "The clay jar cracked in the dry heat.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.38442063331604, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.885672239377862, "dnsmos_sig": 3.487556815536213, "dnsmos_bak": 3.4899425327083358}
{"id": "nat_179", "text": "The loom wove cloth of many colors.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.977433443069458, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.93808900621121, "dnsmos_sig": 3.339137646585627, "dnsmos_bak": 3.759299804286046}
{"id": "nat_180", "text": "The brook flowed cold and clear all year.", "audio_duration_s": 2.8, "utmos": 3.8434290885925293, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.535829555711312, "dnsmos_sig": 2.9924103021092088, "dnsmos_bak": 3.442658193382491}
{"id": "nat_181", "text": "The frost burned the last of the corn.", "audio_duration_s": 2.533333333333333, "utmos": 3.4862730503082275, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.376751624351173, "dnsmos_sig": 3.659126489739388, "dnsmos_bak": 4.114471522912576}
{"id": "nat_182", "text": "The long canoe was carved from a log.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 4.043251037597656, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.315806509101047, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2844767747781263, "dnsmos_bak": 2.6545690153473016}
{"id": "nat_183", "text": "The roan horse ran best on flat ground.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.6178250312805176, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.086059317906208, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2467927990724923, "dnsmos_bak": 2.290155398307858}
{"id": "nat_184", "text": "The fern grew thick in the dark hollow.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8666666666666667, "utmos": 2.8076555728912354, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.697924411877034, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3706737818817354, "dnsmos_bak": 3.3122150830039923}
{"id": "nat_185", "text": "The sharp taste of the brine filled his mouth.", "audio_duration_s": 2.6666666666666665, "utmos": 4.116421699523926, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.8889539342440913, "dnsmos_sig": 3.309727984572093, "dnsmos_bak": 3.705312510786597}
{"id": "nat_186", "text": "The cart horse stood still in the rain.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.8054463863372803, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0703254964014772, "dnsmos_sig": 3.438571494007844, "dnsmos_bak": 3.791069311674497}
{"id": "nat_187", "text": "The red brick house faced the park.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8666666666666667, "utmos": 3.607733726501465, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1481441268431682, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6085218481294596, "dnsmos_bak": 3.7719919010038483}
{"id": "nat_188", "text": "The pale dawn light filled the valley.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2666666666666666, "utmos": 3.513244152069092, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2418334917430207, "dnsmos_sig": 3.552273487883808, "dnsmos_bak": 3.972103985211655}
{"id": "nat_189", "text": "The dry wood burned hot and fast.", "audio_duration_s": 2.4, "utmos": 3.5279409885406494, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.5201007860318807, "dnsmos_sig": 3.34353120535463, "dnsmos_bak": 2.7827345633559863}
{"id": "nat_190", "text": "The neural network achieved state-of-the-art performance on the benchmark.", "audio_duration_s": 4.0, "utmos": 4.146424770355225, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7810953038603556, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3825627774488747, "dnsmos_bak": 3.5073682196152918}
{"id": "nat_191", "text": "Please confirm your appointment for tomorrow at three o'clock.", "audio_duration_s": 3.066666666666667, "utmos": 3.555501937866211, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.727411711696734, "dnsmos_sig": 3.434054156060958, "dnsmos_bak": 3.17351229540553}
{"id": "nat_192", "text": "The quarterly earnings report exceeded analyst expectations by twelve percent.", "audio_duration_s": 4.133333333333334, "utmos": 3.7692394256591797, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1682944636266406, "dnsmos_sig": 3.54827177975024, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9391684385741015}
{"id": "nat_193", "text": "We regret to inform you that your flight has been delayed by two hours.", "audio_duration_s": 3.7333333333333334, "utmos": 3.682633876800537, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.161019434300698, "dnsmos_sig": 3.460268872063775, "dnsmos_bak": 4.064096798090772}
{"id": "nat_194", "text": "The temperature today will reach a high of seventy-two degrees Fahrenheit.", "audio_duration_s": 3.8666666666666667, "utmos": 4.158136367797852, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0692047239234106, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4544986937658777, "dnsmos_bak": 3.87503118268328}
{"id": "nat_195", "text": "Your order has been shipped and will arrive within three to five business days.", "audio_duration_s": 4.133333333333334, "utmos": 3.851318359375, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4242041597648054, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6606707272768153, "dnsmos_bak": 4.14782349102324}
{"id": "nat_196", "text": "The new software update includes several important security patches.", "audio_duration_s": 3.8666666666666667, "utmos": 3.7254252433776855, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7501998727492665, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5129983176670887, "dnsmos_bak": 3.145044915200808}
{"id": "nat_197", "text": "Press one for English, press two for Spanish, or stay on the line.", "audio_duration_s": 3.8666666666666667, "utmos": 4.06216287612915, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2162263202704, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4746940126965673, "dnsmos_bak": 4.046571280293308}
{"id": "nat_198", "text": "The meeting has been rescheduled to next Tuesday at two thirty PM.", "audio_duration_s": 3.6, "utmos": 3.6943044662475586, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.423693696107432, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4702684345182027, "dnsmos_bak": 2.3751009486908563}
{"id": "nat_199", "text": "Thank you for calling customer support. How can I assist you today?", "audio_duration_s": 3.3333333333333335, "utmos": 4.005162715911865, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7929136699021653, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5319856806411294, "dnsmos_bak": 3.3094539774823803}
